 re:{name:'Race engineer',role:'race_engineer',initials:'RE',color:'coral',job:'Frames the task, challenges the team, and writes the final brief.',stages:'S1 frame · S3 challenge · S6 brief',detail:'The first call receives the task, the output schema, and eligible lessons. At S3 the race engineer sees both independent assessments. At S6 it receives the framing, challenge, gathered-data and statistics outputs, plus open objections. It has no tools in these stages.',source:'configs/v1.json'},
