  <div class="bridge-grid"><div class="history-card"><span class="tiny-label">1 / lessons · VECTOR RETRIEVAL</span><h3 style="color:var(--green)">What failed, and why</h3><p>The verified E7 lesson and its source events can be retrieved as context for another improvement proposal.</p>${tag('measurement · verified','good')}${evidence('lesson','Inspect the lesson')}</div><div class="history-card"><span class="tiny-label">2 / harness_versions + experiments</span><h3 style="color:var(--amber)">What was already tried</h3><p>v2 enabled venue_match. It was rejected on R2: 11 development checks passed versus 11.</p>${tag('v2 · rejected','bad')}${evidence('history','Inspect proposal history')}</div></div>
